Dutch regulator orders Endorphina to block its games on unlicensed sites

Dutch gambling regulator Ksa found that players in the Netherlands could access Endorphina slots on sites without a Dutch licence. Inspectors played titles including Hell Hot 100 from a Dutch IP address. The order, dated 19 October and published on 2 November, gave the supplier two weeks to restrict access and report back.

